(Transformer Summarization Report) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
72 730 Td
(Introduction) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 712 Td
(This report describes a complete Transformer-based abstractive summarization system for) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 699 Td
(CNN/DailyMail. The implementation is written from scratch in PyTorch and avoids) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 686 Td
(pretrained or prebuilt Transformer summarization models.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
72 666 Td
(Dataset Description) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 648 Td
(CNN/DailyMail contains news articles paired with human highlights. The notebook) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 635 Td
(downloads the dataset from Hugging Face and uses deterministic train, validation, and) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 622 Td
(unseen test subsets for a CPU-friendly reproducible assignment run.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
72 602 Td
(Data Preprocessing) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 584 Td
(The pipeline removes HTML tags, malformed unicode, non-ASCII symbols, duplicate) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 571 Td
(whitespace, and normalizes quotation marks. Articles are limited to 512 tokens with a) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 558 Td
(first-half plus last-half context window because self-attention memory grows) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 545 Td
(quadratically with sequence length.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
72 525 Td
(Tokenization Method) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 507 Td
(A custom BPE tokenizer is trained on the training corpus with an 8,000-token vocabulary.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 494 Td
(Subword tokenization reduces OOV failures for rare political names, companies, and) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 481 Td
(geographic locations by decomposing uncommon words into reusable pieces.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
72 461 Td
(Transformer Architecture) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 443 Td
(The model contains token embeddings, sinusoidal positional encodings, encoder blocks,) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 430 Td
(decoder blocks, feed-forward layers, residual connections, and layer normalization.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 417 Td
(Encoder and decoder stacks are implemented as modular PyTorch classes.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
72 397 Td
(Attention Mechanism) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 379 Td
(Multi-head attention explicitly computes query, key, and value projections, splits) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 366 Td
(heads, applies Softmax\(QK^T / sqrt\(d\)\), combines values, concatenates heads, and) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 353 Td
(projects the output. The decoder cross-attention uses decoder states as queries and) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 340 Td
(encoder outputs as keys and values.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
72 320 Td
(Masking Strategy) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 302 Td
(Padding masks have shape \(batch_size, 1, 1, source_length\) and prevent attention to PAD) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 289 Td
(tokens. Causal masks are lower-triangular visibility matrices with shape \(target_length,) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 276 Td
(target_length\), preventing each target position from seeing future tokens.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
72 256 Td
(Training Methodology) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 238 Td
(Training uses teacher forcing: the decoder receives BOS-prefixed summaries and predicts) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 225 Td
(shifted target summaries ending with EOS. The loss is cross entropy with label smoothing) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 212 Td
(0.1, optimized by AdamW with a learning-rate scheduler for at least three epochs.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
72 192 Td
(ROUGE Results) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 174 Td
(The notebook and train.py compute ROUGE-1, ROUGE-2, and ROUGE-L on at least five unseen) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 161 Td
(test articles after greedy decoding. Exact values depend on the selected subset and) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 148 Td
(available compute, but the scoring pipeline is fully implemented.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf
72 128 Td
(Error Analysis) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 110 Td
(With the default small CPU subset, generated summaries can repeat tokens, omit secondary) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 97 Td
(facts, hallucinate common news phrases, or stop early. These errors are typical of) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 84 Td
(undertrained small Transformers and can be mitigated with more data, larger dimensions,) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
72 71 Td
(and longer training.) Tj
